Fix HTTP 400 when sending an attachment-only chat message

Pasting an image with no caption failed with "No user message found in
input": the runs API reads input as messages, but we sent raw content parts
with no role wrapper, and an empty caption left the text part blank.

- Wrap multimodal turns in a proper user message (role + content parts) so the
  gateway finds the user message.
- Supply a neutral prompt ("Please take a look at the attached image." /
  "Please review the attached file.") when the caption is empty, so an
  attachment-only turn still carries user text.

Note: whether the agent can actually read the image depends on the selected
model being vision-capable; a text-only model will say it can't see images.

